WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.819
Mrs. West: Thank you for taking care of the puppies.

2
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:17.443
I will be back soon. Sam:

3
00:00:17.444 --> 00:00:22.610
Lucky! Come here. Tia:

4
00:00:22.611 --> 00:00:35.620
Sadie's puppies are here, Lucky! Tia:

5
00:00:35.621 --> 00:00:42.349
The puppies are so cute! Sam:

6
00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:50.934
They really like you, Lucky! Lucky:

7
00:00:50.935 --> 00:00:59.530
Woof! Woof! Sam:

8
00:00:59.531 --> 00:01:03.261
Look at the puppies run!

9
00:01:03.262 --> 00:01:06.735
Let's follow them, Lucky! Tia:

10
00:01:06.736 --> 00:01:20.706
Hey! Wait for us, puppies! Sam:

11
00:01:20.707 --> 00:01:26.537
Here we come! Sorry, Mom! Mom:

12
00:01:26.538 --> 00:01:33.895
Those puppies are very busy. Tia:

13
00:01:33.896 --> 00:01:40.886
Wow! These puppies are very hungry too.

14
00:01:40.887 --> 00:01:44.619
Sam: And they're thirsty.

15
00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:59.351
Ha-ha! Now they are eating Lucky's food! Tia:

16
00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:11.929
There go the puppies again. Sam:

17
00:02:11.930 --> 00:02:25.538
Look, Lucky. They like your food—and your toys!

18
00:02:25.539 --> 00:02:33.083
Sam: These puppies are so much fun. Right, Lucky?

19
00:02:33.084 --> 00:02:40.465
Lucky: Grr . . .

